nt reply….\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply….\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply….\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…..\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…...\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◓  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◑  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◒  Waiting for agent reply…\u001b[1G\u001b[J◐  Waiting for agent reply….\u001b[1G\u001b[J◇  \n\u001b[?25hMETA\n\n- SEO Title: CLARITY Act: Coinography Tracks Bitcoin Market Shift\n- Meta Description: Track how the CLARITY Act lifted Bitcoin sentiment, what Santiment's 1.55 ratio signals, and which market structure levels traders should watch next.\n- URL Slug: clarity-act-bitcoin-sentiment-market-structure\n- Categories: Bitcoin News, Latest News\n- Primary Keyword: CLARITY Act\n- Secondary Keywords: Bitcoin sentiment, market structure\n\n# CLARITY Act lifts Bitcoin to $79,084 as sentiment jumps\n\nCLARITY Act momentum pushed Bitcoin to $79,084 after the bill cleared its first major bipartisan checkpoint. BTC is now up 3.15% since May 1, which put U.S. regulation back at the center of crypto price action.\n\nSantiment said Bitcoin drew 1.55 bullish social media comments for every bearish one, while the Crypto Fear & Greed Index stayed at 31, or Fear. That mix tells traders optimism is improving faster than broader risk appetite.\n\nThis is a policy momentum trade, not a finished legislative win.\n\n## Bitcoin sentiment: What the CLARITY Act signals\n\nThe market is reacting to the path toward clearer rules, not to a law that is already finished. [Cointelegraph reported](https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-clarity-act-brings-major-spike-of-euphoria-to-bitcoin-santiment) that traders treated the latest CLARITY Act progress as a sign that U.S. crypto oversight may finally become more predictable.\n\nThat same policy angle shaped the broader narrative. [Decrypt described the vote](https://decrypt.co/367946/morning-minute-the-clarity-act-just-passed-its-first-major-vote) as the bill clearing its first major bipartisan checkpoint, which is exactly the kind of procedural progress that can lift Bitcoin sentiment before final passage.\n\n[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]\n\n### Social mood is running ahead of price\n\nSantiment's 1.55-to-1 bullish-versus-bearish ratio is the clearest sign that tone shifted fast. Traders are leaning into the view that regulatory clarity could improve the setup for Bitcoin, exchanges, ETFs, and trading firms operating in the U.S.\n\nThat is also why Santiment's warning matters. When positioning gets too one-sided too early, the market can shake out even if the long-term story still looks constructive.\n\n- Bitcoin traded at $79,084.\n- BTC gained 3.15% since May 1.\n- Bullish Bitcoin commentary beat bearish commentary by 1.55 to 1.\n\n### Clearer rules are the real bid\n\nThe longer-term case is simple. If the CLARITY Act keeps advancing, institutions that stayed cautious around U.S. market structure may get a clearer framework for participation.\n\n[58 more lines in file. Use offset=41 to continue.][... 6914 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778921574881}}
